<title>USA: Diebold Inc sets 2 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Diebold Inc sets 2 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CANTON, Ohio 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diebold Inc said it Thursday it authorized the repurchase of up to two million common shares in the open market.</p>
<p>The timing and amount purchased from time to time will depend on prevailing share market prices and trading volume. Diebold also said shares that are acquired will be held as treasury shares and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
